  "schema:name": "Person-centred point of service (PCPOSS)",
  "schema:description": "Person-centred point of service system (PCPOSS) and its four specialized application types (electronic health record system, decision support system, community-based information system, personal health record), the five PCPOSS digital health intervention services (Section 1.1, PDF 18), end-user roles (Health worker and Health service user / Patients), and interoperability with foundational DPI-H registries, repositories, terminology, clinical decision support and analytics (Fig. 4, Section 4.4, PDF 18-19, 56-60).",
